<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/xapi-document> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Document data stored through the xAPI State, Agent Profile, or Activity Profile Resources. These resources store state or profile information in a generic document form scoped to an Activity, Agent or Identified Group, and, for State, optionally a registration." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/xapi-document/versions/1> .
