<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/xapi-document> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "Documents let xAPI applications persist state and profile information outside immutable Statements while keeping that information associated with the relevant Activity, Agent, Group, or registration." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/xapi-document/versions/1> .
